  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nAs [mentioned](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10287#issuecomment-2077766671) in the last WHATNOT meeting, the first meeting for the joint OpenUI-WHATWG/HTML-CSSWG task force on styleable form controls is scheduled for Wednesday May 8, 2024 at 8am PDT. The meeting will take place in the CSSWG virtual meeting room and IRC channel. \r\n\r\nIf you would like to attend, please reach out to me or any of the other group chairs or participants. I will add a link to the minutes afterwards in this issue.",
